OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas markets 2026: Where to
OL,4,Ago in the South
OL,5,
OL,6,FChristmas markets are returning to town
OL,7,Fcentres, cathedral grounds and stately
OL,8,Fhomes across the south of England.
OL,10,FSome of the biggest are already open,
OL,11,Fwith markets in Southampton and
OL,12,FBournemouth both starting on 12
OL,13,FNovember and running until late
OL,14,FDecember.
OL,16,FWinchester Cathedral's market, which
OL,17,Fthe city's tourism body calls one of
OL,18,Fthe best in Europe, opens on 20
OL,19,FNovember, with Oxford's Broad Street
OL,20,Fmarket following a day later.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
